</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveArithmeticSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(\\omega\\setminus A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveArithmeticSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(\\omega\\setminus A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Recursive sets are exactly the sets whose positive and negative membership problems are both computably enumerable, equivalently the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^0_1\">\\(\\Delta^0_1\\)</span> sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"618dc6ad8d6c1e22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveArithmeticSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveArithmeticSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(A)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(\\omega\\setminus A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta^0_1","display":false}],"bytes":1032,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-recursive-arithmetic-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursive-arithmetic-set]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","618dc6ad8d6c1e22"]}